    <briefdescription>
<para>Local implementation of source location information for diagnostics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a lightweight, constexpr-compatible alternative to <computeroutput>std::source_location</computeroutput> for environments lacking C++20 standard support.</para>
<para>It enables retrieval of the file name and line number at the point of invocation, supporting enhanced diagnostics and reporting within the µTest++ framework.</para>
<para>The static <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1reflection_1_1source__location_1af2ee3ac5db96f13680291736d58fe327" kindref="member">current()</ref></computeroutput> method captures the current source location, using compiler built-ins where available, or defaulting to <computeroutput>"unknown"</computeroutput> and zero otherwise.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="since"><para>3.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
